  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Quality in education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to create quality learning environment in schools and communities so children learn basic literacy, numeracy and life skills, and experience improved level of well-being. The project will target communities in in the Sud and Grand Anse departments, working closely with girls and boys, parents, teachers, school directors and other community leaders. In addition, it aims to strengthen civil society organisations and government authorities so that children&apos;s rights are fulfilled.</narrative>
  </description>
